      "amount": "1/2 teaspoon"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large Dutch oven over medium high heat.",
    "Add the lamb to the pot and cook until browned on all sides, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the onion and garlic to the pot and cook until the onion is translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the rocket, apricots, chicken broth, lemon juice, cumin, and paprika to the pot, stirring to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 1 1/2 hours.",
    "Season the tagine with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Serve the tagine hot, garnished with fresh rocket and lemon wedges."
